{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：15:44 2026-11-02 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"旺角逸里1號夥滙豐推3或5年定息按揭  最快周末開售\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d4161e7ac4eae7de53efec5e2247dae5/2026-11/KF_Christine_58_.png\"/>\n<p>恒基發展旺角逸里1號，恒基物業代理董事及營業(二)部總經理韓家輝表示，短期內上載銷售安排，部署今個周末首輪銷售。</p>\n<p>韓家輝指，客源方面不乏換樓客，亦有不少投資客有意入市，預計項目單位能吸引租客，公司會視乎市況決定加推步伐。</p>\n<p>相關文章：旺角逸里1號貼市開價 首批50伙 每呎203萬 折實501萬入場 樓花期僅3個月</p>\n<h2>定息2.93厘 後為H加1.3厘 可借最高7成</h2>\n<p>滙豐香港區財富管理及個人銀行按揭業務主管徐凱廉表示，該行為項目買家提供3年或5年定息按揭，期間息率鎖定2.93厘，其後為H加1.3厘，可借最高7成。若於明年4月30日前提取按揭，可享3,888元獎賞，另設500元網上申請獎賞。</p>\n<p>發展商今開放3間現樓示範單位及部分會所設施供傳媒參觀，料於下一個階段再開予公眾，開放的無裝修示範單位為27樓的A、B及D室。</p>\n<h3>27樓A室現樓單位：</h3>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f3360f588fbb8dd1e34161a7803fad9a/2026-11/27A.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/284d6a620fa71f3a82cd27adf4dc302c/2026-11/27A2.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fdb01e2c620d917f1287e35769989049/2026-11/27A3.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f272a105a014a243c338ab0fbad37580/2026-11/27A4.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/77d94862dd008ccffa31ff2b58a1b1c1/2026-11/27A5.jpg\"/>\n<h3>27樓B室現樓單位：</h3>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/77e7d6e6e173afd52b393a4004dd8114/2026-11/27B1.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/aa764f3798a7be54e5f5d24fe2580a58/2026-11/27B2.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c9b0a3f787e50a9d3329087dd5d3410d/2026-11/27B3.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4ec88ff3ab830a710c9c0d62b6b2b2ae/2026-11/27B4.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4e8bcef83f9e0b864d028ea63c9717e7/2026-11/27B5.jpg\"/>\n<h3>現樓會所：</h3>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2a0dab41d902ed74dbc8ce9ac04a1a84/2026-11/DSC00601_R.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/27586f70a2f091954d2ea039630de7b7/2026-11/DSC00604_R.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a7d7d84522f7c1762d01f9c2abab2fd6/2026-11/DSC00610_R.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/77a19753da314ddff034fd35b96d1de5/2026-11/DSC00613_R.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T08:00:47.104441+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":411,"images":15,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T07:44:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T11:38:44.507897+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T07:58:19.213638+00:00","content_hash":"2bea9975a7c49cc1b1887b95438053d8ff1abe3f4b8a44377c90477c20bf7f46","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}